[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙和米莉亚带我来到了<br>图书室。|#0204Adv16_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不知道为什么要来这里，<br>也没有力气去思考。|#0204Adv16_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只是眼神空洞、<br>茫然自失地，<br>坐在阅读区的椅子上。|#0204Adv16_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙从某处取来一本书，<br>放在桌上。|#0204Adv16_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 机に本を置く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_42 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『魔女の本』表示
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:10-11

[PrintTextModified Text:是我曾经见过的书。|#0204Adv16_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚被关进监牢没多久，<br>雪莉她们给我看过的，<br>关于魔女的那本书——|#0204Adv16_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自那天看过之后，我几乎已经将它忘却。<br>|#0204Adv16_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:内容也记不得太多了。|#0204Adv16_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这本书到底有什么意义……？|#0204Adv16_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我喃喃自语，翻开书页。|#0204Adv16_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

; 本のページをぱらぱらめくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_43 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:2

; ========================================
; ＞挿入歌『救いを求めるヒトの詩』
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_40_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; ＠備考◆息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0204Adv16_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随着书页翻动，<br>我的双眼逐渐瞪大。|#0204Adv16_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:书上是曾被囚禁于此的少女们<br>写下的文字。|#0204Adv16_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了解读那些奇异的文字，她们逐页留下笔迹。<br>那真是，太多太多……<br>数不清的解读笔记与努力的痕迹。|#0204Adv16_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:是樱羽提出来的点子。<br>大家一个接一个，<br>花了许多时间一点点写上去的。|#0204Adv16_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:小艾她，似乎一直没能<br>把这本书传到小希你手上。<br>|#0204Adv16_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以你应该<br>还没看过这本书，对吧……？|#0204Adv16_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我轻轻点了点头。同时——|#0204Adv16_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一颗颗泪水夺眶而出，<br>啪嗒啪嗒滴落在书页上。|#0204Adv16_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊——原来、是这样啊）|#0204Adv16_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:当时在玛格的牢房，<br>艾玛突然收起进怀里并带走的东西。|#0204Adv16_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那不是什么凶器。<br>而是这本书。|#0204Adv16_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我轻抚着这些笔迹。<br>这是她们确实曾在这里活过的证明。|#0204Adv16_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro

[PrintTextModified Text:大部分都、已经解读完成了……|#0204Adv16_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我一直以为，自己是孤独一人在挣扎。<br>　可原来，大家也一直在这么努力战斗着——）|#0204Adv16_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria

[PrintTextModified Text:……我该走了。|#0204Adv16_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我将那本书轻轻抱抱在胸前，<br>站起身。|#0204Adv16_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，迈出了脚步。|#0204Adv16_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

