[PrintTextModified Text:……希罗呀。<br>别太责怪艾玛她们哦。<br>我也曾经有过类似的想法。|#0204Adv16_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你也想越狱？|#0204Adv16_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。考虑如何离开这里<br>不是很正常吗？|#0204Adv16_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:反抗看守很危险。<br>还是安分一点比较好。|#0204Adv16_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,20 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:……你说得对。<br>这次的事让我明白事情没那么简单，<br>我打算再多调查一下这里。|#0204Adv16_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗真的很可靠呢。<br>让我们一起对抗魔女吧——|#0204Adv16_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

