[PrintTextModified Text:再说……|#0204Adv16_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样一来……就不会再有人被处刑了，对不对……？|#0204Adv16_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟，根本就没有什么凶手啊……|#0204Adv16_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想再看到任何人死去了……这种事根本就是错误的……|#0204Adv16_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经不想再……<br>眼睁睁看着任何人死去了！|#0204Adv16_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

