[PrintTextModified Text:有希罗在我身边真好。|#0204Adv16_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅抬起头，笑着对我说道。|#0204Adv16_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是你的坚强支撑着我。|#0204Adv16_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能走到现在，<br>一定是因为希罗一直在我身边。|#0204Adv16_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

