[PrintTextModified Text:她们也许早就察觉了我的魔法。<br>|#0204Adv16_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可如今，连这件事都无法向她们求证了。|#0204Adv16_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:4_1
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜的留言，<br>像在嬉笑打闹般地夹杂其中。|#0204Adv16_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @show Clue

[PrintTextModified Text:——根据我雪莉的名侦探推理！|#0204Adv16_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——所谓【集齐十三名魔女】，<br>或许指的是我们所有人必须完全魔女化才行呢。<br>|#0204Adv16_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我才不想变成魔女呢。|#0204Adv16_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——那就完了呀！根本不可能了，笑死！|#0204Adv16_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——要是所有人都能得救的话，<br>我勉为其难变成魔女也不是不行啦。|#0204Adv16_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——呜哇～～这么高高在上，那真是谢谢大小姐啦！|#0204Adv16_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @hide Clue

