[PrintTextModified Text:但是……但是，我，<br>我真的不想变成魔女……|#0204Adv16_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算这么肮脏，<br>罪孽这么深重，还是想作为一个人……|#0204Adv16_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; @back 470_8 id:Stills scale:1 time:0 tint:#dfd1a2

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托了，在我还是人的时候杀了我吧——！|#0204Adv16_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要把我变成怪物啊！<br>就算死我也想保持自己还是人的样子！|#0204Adv16_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然你说不想被抛弃，<br>那我们就一起走吧！|#0204Adv16_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有我陪着你！所以汉娜，你已经没事了！<br>我不会抛弃你，<br>更不会让你被人抛弃！|#0204Adv16_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} TintColor:#dfd1a2 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:470_9

[PrintTextModified Text:绝对不会让你变成残骸！|#0204Adv16_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

