[PrintTextModified Text:本以为眼泪早已流尽，<br>一丝滚烫还是顺着脸颊流去。|#0204Adv16_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我终于找到了真正的艾玛。|#0204Adv16_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我终于找到了“正确”。|#0204Adv16_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我……如果能够实现的话，<br>　只想再一次，和你们相见）|#0204Adv16_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我的愿望仅此而已）|#0204Adv16_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
